@startuml
participant Alice
participant Bob
note left of Alice #aqua
This is displayed
left of Alice.
end note

note right of Alice: This is displayed right of Alice.

note over Alice: This is displayed over Alice.

note over Alice, Bob #FFAAAA: This is displayed\n over Bob and Alice.

note over Bob, Alice
This is yet another
example of
a long note.
end note

Alice -> Bob : hello
note left : on the left of the message
Bob -> Alice : back
note right : and on the right
hnote over Alice : hexagonal note
rnote over Bob : rectangle note
note across: spans across everything
@enduml
